  "title": "EU Kids Act Bans Social Media for Under-13s",
  "summary": "The EU's new Kids Act plans to ban social media access for children under 13, making it the first EU country to implement such a ban. The law aims to address concerns about cyberbullying and social media addiction, and will require platforms to verify users' age.",
